//- index.pug
doctype html
html
  include includes/head.pug
  body
    nav#intro
      .nav__content
        a.nav__title.nav__title--desktop.text--large(href="#intro")  Daniel Hearn
        a.nav__title.nav__title--mobile.text--large(href="#intro")  Dan Hearn
        div.nav__links
          a.text--small(href="#work") work
          a.text--small(href="#about") about
          a.text--small(href="/blog/") blog
    main
      section.container.intro
        h1.text--medium
          | Hi, I'm Dan—a Senior Software Engineer at 
          a.link(href=links.freshrelevance) Dotdigital.
      #content
        section.container.experience
          h3.text--large.heading Senior Software Engineer at Dotdigital (Fresh Relevance)
          h2.text--medium.sub-heading July 2020 - Current
          p.text--small
            | At Dotdigital I develop user interfaces with
            | React, Redux, and TypeScript. Including being responsible for projects, working on larger connected feature sets,
            | maintaining existing features, migrating older technology, along with implementing high-priority changes and fixes. I also increasingly work on backend services in Python and Node often in work involving content delivery, data processing, and reporting.
          p.text--small
            | Examples of projects include: Testing & Optimization UI, Site Info Bar, SmartBlock Builder, Top and Item Level Reporting, Product Management, Product Details, UI theme overhauls.
          p.text--small
            | I also assist the client scripting team by owning time critical customer facing issues and
            | have previously supported placement students.
          p.text--small
            | Over this time I have been promoted from Junior to Middle Level and then onto Senior Software Engineer.
        section.container.experience
          h3.text--large.heading Placement at Fresh Relevance
          h2.text--medium.sub-heading July 2018 - May 2019
          p.text--small
            | I was responsible for integrating Fresh Relevance's system with their 
            | client's e-commerce sites. Additionally, I developed React-based 
            | user interfaces and improved the processing of user data in the backend.
        section.container.experience
          h3.text--large.heading University of Portsmouth
          h2.text--medium.sub-heading Sept 2016 - May 2020
          p.text--small
            | I achieved a First in BSc Computer Science along with the British Computer Society Prize 
            | for Best Final Year Student in my course.
          p.text--small
            | As my final year project I built a internet-of-things
            | climate monitoring system with a web-app allowing users to view 
            | recorded statistics about the local climates around them. This used hardware including Raspberry Pi, micro-controllers, radio modules, sensors and batteries. With the web-app and backend built with Vue, Python (Flask), SQLite.
        section.container.projects#work
          h3.text--large Personal Projects
          section.grid.grid--2
            each project in projects
              include includes/project.pug
        section.container.about#about
          .about__content.grid-item--col-1-3
            h3.text--large About Me
            p.text--small
              | I host my personal project code on 
              a.link(href=links.github) Github
              | . 
            p.text--small
              | I'm proficient in React, Typescript, Python (Django, Flask), Node, Vue;
              | while using Copilot, MCPs, Webpack, Gulp, Git, in my workflow. 
              | Additionally, I have experience with SQL and MongoDB.
            p.text--small
              | I've been writing board and video game reviews and opinion on 
              a.text--small.link(href="/blog/") my blog
              | . 
      section.container.footer
        div
          a.text--small(href=links.github) Github
          a.text--small(href=links.email) Email
          a.text--small(href=links.blog) Blog
  include includes/footer.pug